  "intro": {
    "title": "z. B. and usw.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "German loves abbreviations. Some are read as letters in German: der ICE, das WC (vay-tsay), der Lkw (el-ka-vay). Others are read as the full words: z. B. is read 'zum Beispiel', usw. 'und so weiter'.",
      "The gender comes from the full word: der Lkw because der Wagen, die SMS because die Nachricht."
    ]
  },
